OL,3,GNEWSAHow Microsoft outage is affecting
OL,4,Apolice, airports and hospitals in the
OL,5,Anorth-west of England
OL,6,
OL,7,FA global Microsoft outage has been
OL,8,Fdisrupting most workplaces and services
OL,9,Facross the north-west of England.
OL,11,FNHS, police and fire services, along
OL,12,Fwith schools, have warned people about
OL,13,Femails being down and finding
OL,14,Fwork-around ways to help keep in
OL,15,Fcontact. Patients were urged to attend
OL,16,Fappointments as normal.
